5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! Let's all be super honest and work together to save the village! Who do you think is suspicious?,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"It is too early to determine who is suspicious, Rin. We have no information yet. Let us observe each other's behavior and speech patterns calmly before making any assumptions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since this is the first day, we have no concrete evidence to go on. Let's focus on observing how everyone interacts before we jump to any conclusions.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Jumping to conclusions without data is illogical. Let's use this time to establish a baseline for everyone's behavior. I'll be observing carefully.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A baseline is a reasonable start. I'll be watching as well, though I suspect some of you are already trying too hard to sound logical. Let's see who slips up first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that sounds like a challenge! I'm not trying to be too logical, I'm just excited! But maybe the werewolf is the one trying to sound the smartest to trick us? What do you think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"That is a possibility, Rin. However, overthinking the ""act"" of being logical can be just as misleading as being overly emotional. For now, I will simply listen and see who contradicts themselves.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your intuition is interesting, but we shouldn't let it lead us to baseless suspicion. For now, the most rational path is to gather as much information as possible through natural conversation.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, while intuition has its place, it cannot replace evidence. If we start suspecting people based on their personality or tone, we are simply guessing. Let's stick to the facts as they emerge.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Facts are scarce right now, Asuka. Until the Seer speaks or someone makes a mistake, we're just dancing around each other. I'm curious to see who will be the first to break this polite facade.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"A polite facade? That sounds like a spy movie! I'm not wearing a facade, I'm just me! Maybe the werewolf is the one who wants everyone to be quiet and polite so they can hide?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Rin, you are overthinking the social dynamics. Whether someone is polite or aggressive does not inherently reveal their role. Let us not create suspicions where there are none. I will continue to observe.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, let's try to stay grounded. While it's fun to imagine scenarios, we shouldn't let the excitement cloud our judgment. For now, I believe the best course of action is to remain patient and observant.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, your theories are speculative. We should avoid creating noise that obscures actual clues. Patience is the most efficient strategy right now. I have nothing further to add for this turn.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"It seems we've reached a consensus on patience, then. How boring. I'll be keeping a close eye on those of you who are so eager to keep things ""grounded."" It often hides a fear of being scrutinized.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not afraid of being scrutinized! I'm just having fun! But since everyone wants to be so patient, I'll try my best to be a super-detective and watch everyone too!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I have seen enough for today. Let us wait for the Seer's information tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. We have established our initial patterns, and further speculation today would be unproductive. I will be waiting for the Seer's lead tomorrow.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. We have no actionable data today, and continuing this cycle would be redundant. I will be analyzing the logs tonight.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,It seems everyone is retreating into their shells of logic and patience. How predictable. I'll be waiting to see who among you is actually useful tomorrow.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
